  <diagram name="Axiom Aether — First-Principles Derivation" id="axiom-aether-007">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <!-- Title -->
        <mxCell id="ax-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Axiom Aether — First-Principles Derivation Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: #666;&quot;&gt;The escape hatch from social consensus falsehoods — derive truth from immutable axioms via Curry-Howard correspondence&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="900" x="20" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <!-- Purpose Box -->
        <mxCell id="ax-purpose" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;When social constructs dictate that a fact is false/impossible, or when deception is the status quo, the model bypasses &quot;social facts&quot; entirely and requests an immutable logical derivation via the AxiomAether pipeline. This is the first-principles escape hatch for ELP0/ELP1 textual derivation.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="400" x="20" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <!-- Theory Box -->
        <mxCell id="ax-theory" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=25;fillColor=#e1d5e7;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Theoretical Foundations — The Axioms Behind the Aether 📐&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="1760" x="20" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ax-curry" parent="ax-theory" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;Curry-Howard Correspondence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;Propositions as Types [Wadler2015]&lt;br&gt;Proofs as Programs&lt;br&gt;Simplification as Evaluation&lt;br&gt;Underpins AXIOM_DERIVE structure&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="200" x="20" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ax-construct" parent="ax-theory" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constructivism&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;Piaget1952Origins, Vygotsky1978Mind&lt;br&gt;Knowledge is constructed, not received&lt;br&gt;Truth must be derived, not assumed&lt;br&gt;Guides first-principles approach&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="200" x="240" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
