        <!-- Integration Note -->
        <mxCell id="ax-integration" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#d5e8d4;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;Integration with Main Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;• AxiomAether is invoked from model_manager.adb Generate() loop&lt;br&gt;• Separate from Context Fault loop (which handles factual retrieval)&lt;br&gt;• AxiomAether handles logical derivation, not data fetching&lt;br&gt;• Results feed back into Internal_State for next reasoning hop&lt;br&gt;• Priority: AxiomAether derivations override social consensus facts&lt;br&gt;• Code: model_manager.adb lines 9331-9458&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
